# Lab 9: a dangling delegation. legacy is delegated to two name servers
# that no longer exist, so a resolver asked about it answers SERVFAIL, and
# whoever registers either name answers for the whole subzone. staging is
# delegated to a name server that still answers. Run:
#   subenum -simulate-zone lab9 -type A,NS -format jsonl lab.example
# Then run it again without -type and compare.
@          A      192.0.2.1
@          NS     ns1
ns1        A      192.0.2.53
www        A      192.0.2.10
legacy     NS     ns1.legacy-dns.example.
legacy     NS     ns2.legacy-dns.example.
staging    NS     ns1
